# Paths where a mistake is silent and expensive.
#
# Honest caveat: with a single collaborator this file does not currently enforce anything.
# GitHub will not let you be a required reviewer of your own pull request, so turning on
# "Require review from Code Owners" would make every solo PR unmergeable. Leave that setting
# off until a second collaborator exists.
#
# Until then its value is that it marks the sensitive surface — for humans reading a diff and
# for agents reading the repo — and it starts enforcing the moment someone else is added.

